{"step_index":536,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:47:43Z","thinking":"**Refining Submission Flow**\n\nI'm altering the `submitProcess` function; it won't navigate away. It'll now be responsible only for initiating and listening for event updates! I've also identified the crucial locations in `index.html` where I'll manage the `currentProcessId` and the `activeProcesses` counter, around line 983, where I'll add listeners for `process_update` events.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Fix logic to not navigate until process is complete","EndLine":1255,"Instruction":"Update submitProcess to only show progress bar, and add event listeners for process_update and process_complete","ReplacementContent":"async function submitProcess() {\n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n    const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n    \n    btn.classList.add('hidden');\n    progressArea.classList.remove('hidden');\n    \n    try {\n        const result = await window.pywebview.api.start_process(\n            JSON.stringify(selectedWarehouseFiles),\n            JSON.stringify(selectedShortageFiles)\n        );\n        \n        if (result && result.process_id) {\n            currentProcessId = result.process_id;\n            window.activeProcesses = (window.activeProcesses || 0) + 1;\n            showToast('بدأت المطابقة في الخلفية!', 'success');\n        } else if (result && result.existing) {\n            // Already exists\n            currentProcessId = result.process_id;\n            showToast('هذه العملية مسجلة بالفعل، جاري عرض النتائج...', 'success');\n            if (result.stats) {\n                loadResults(result.stats);\n                window.showScreen('screen-results');\n            }\n            btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n            progressArea.classList.add('hidden');\n        } else {\n            throw new Error(result.error || 'لم يتم إرجاع معرف العملية');\n        }\n    } catch (error) {\n        showToast('حدث خطأ أثناء بدء المطابقة: ' + error, 'error');\n        console.error(error);\n        btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n        progressArea.classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('process_update', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n    if (progressArea && !progressArea.classList.contains('hidden') && data.process_id === currentProcessId) {\n        // Update a hypothetical progress text element if it existed, or just keep loading\n        const msgEl = progressArea.querySelector('p');\n        if (msgEl && data.message) msgEl.innerText = data.message;\n    }\n});\n\nwindow.addEventListener('process_complete', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    window.activeProcesses = Math.max(0, (window.activeProcesses || 1) - 1);\n    \n    if (data.process_id === currentProcessId) {\n        const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n        const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n        \n        btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n        progressArea.classList.add('hidden');\n        \n        if (data.success) {\n            showToast('تمت المطابقة بنجاح!', 'success');\n            if (data.stats) {\n                loadResults(data.stats);\n            }\n            window.showScreen('screen-results');\n        } else {\n            showToast('فشلت عملية المطابقة: ' + data.error, 'error');\n        }\n    }\n});\n\n// --- Results Logic ---","StartLine":1225,"TargetContent":"async function submitProcess() {\n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n    const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n    \n    btn.classList.add('hidden');\n    progressArea.classList.remove('hidden');\n    \n    try {\n        const result = await window.pywebview.api.start_process(\n            JSON.stringify(selectedWar