tatus: PLANNING)\n- **User's intent**: \"الشاشة فيها scroll، احنا قلنا الموضوع يبقى flexible، يعني على حسب حجم الشاشة... مش نافع الحوار ده.\"\n- **Remaining Work**: Update `index.html` CSS so `body` and `.app-layout` are `overflow: hidden`, and only internal containers (like `.main-content` or file lists) scroll independently.\n\n### Exit Confirmation Warning (Status: NOT STARTED)\n- **User's intent**: \"لما تكون الـ process شغالة وأنا حابب أغلق البرنامج، تجيء لي كده ايه هل أنت متاكد؟... عشان خاطر لما أقفل يبقى أنا عارف إن أنا ايه البرنامج لسه شغال.\"\n- **Remaining Work**: Hook into `exitApp()` in JS to check if `window.activeProcesses > 0` and show a JS `confirm()` dialog before calling `window.pywebview.api.exit_app()`.\n\n### History Screen Not Updating (Status: NOT STARTED)\n- **User's intent**: \"رحت الهيستوري فرجعت تاني لقيت العملية بيقول لي من جديد فبدأت من أول جديد، ما عملتهاش في الهيستوري، المفروض تكون متسجلة في الهيستوري\"\n- **Remaining Work**: The history screen isn't populating properly after a process starts. Need to ensure `loadHistory()` is triggered and rendering correctly.\n\n### Multi-language UI Support (Status: SUGGESTED)\n- **User's intent**: \"عايز ممكن نضيف لغة ثانية اللي هو الإنجليزي في البرنامج... وتظبط حوار الـ right to left وleft to right\"\n- **Remaining Work**: Postponed for now. Focus on critical bugs first.\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n### Direct User Quotes & Feedback\n- **On Background UI/Logs:** \"أنا قلت لك اعمل لي log تحت الـ system عشان أشوف الحاجات اللي بتظهر في الـ terminal تبع الـ process اللي هي pipeline... أي حاجه في الـ background كله إنجليزي.\"\n- **On Processing UX:** \"أول ما بعمل مطابقة، بيدخلنا على تقرير النتائج على طول، ويجي لي 0 0 0... ما يتعملش اللودينج والبار عشوائي، يعني البار ده يبقى على حسب هو وصل في مرحلة إيه\".\n- **On Duplicates & History:** \"المفروض ما تعملش بدء وتوديني على العملية اللي واخدة نفس الملفات... المفروض تكون متسجلة في الهيستوري وتبدأ تشغلها في الهيستوري في الباك جراوند لحد لما تكتمل.\"\n- **On Exiting:** \"تجيء لي كده ايه هل أنت متاكد، يوجد عمليات في الخلفية؟\"\n\n### API Keys & Credentials\n- **MSEMAX API Key**: `[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]` (Server at `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX\\`)\n- **Unstructured.io API Key**: stored in project `.env` file at `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\.env`\n\n---\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n- **Fixed Drag & Drop Deadlock & Edge Restrictions**: Edge WebView2 completely hides local file paths from drag & drop events (`e.dataTransfer.files[0].path` is empty). **Solution implemented**: Read files in JS using `FileReader` as Base64, transfer the raw data to Python (`api.save_dropped_file`), and save to `%TEMP%/pharmacy_matcher_drops/`. This completely bypasses all Edge security restrictions and works perfectly. Removed the buggy native pywebview drop hooks.\n- **Fixed Exit Deadlock**: Replaced `self.window.destroy()` with `os._exit(0)` in `backend.py:exit_app`. The app now exits instantly without \"Not Responding\" freezes.\n- **UI Improvements**: Redesigned the file list items into modern styled chips with file-type icons and a clean circular delete button, removing the ugly \"X\" box the user complained about.\n- **Strict File Validation**: Added `processSelectedFiles` in JS to validate file extensions before accepting them (rejects images, allows only `.pdf, .xlsx, .xls, .csv` for shortages, plus `.json` for warehouses).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### Architecture & Fixes\n- **Async UI vs Python Threads**: `start_process` runs in a background `threading.Thread`. Previously, the UI synchronously navigated to the Results screen expecting stats. **Fix started**: The UI now waits for `CustomEvent('process_update')` and `CustomEvent('process_complete')` dispatched from Python via `self.window.evaluate_js()`.\n- **Drag & Drop Workaround**: Do not attempt to use `window.events.dropped` in `app.py`. It fails or deadlocks on Windows WebView2. The pure HTML5 Base64 implementation in `index.html` is robust and complete.\n- **Encoding Issues**: Windows PowerShell struggles with Arabic text in stdout/stderr. Ensure all backend `self.add_log()` and `print()` statements in `_process_worker` are explicitly written in English.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- **`d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\backend.py`**\n  - *Changes*: Added `save_dropped_file` (Base64 decoding to `%TEMP%`). Swapped `window.destroy()` for `os._exit(0)`. Updated `start_process` to check `existing_processes` for duplicates. Updated `_process_worker` to emit `process_update` and `process_complete` JS events and translate logs to English.\n- **`d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`**\n  - *Changes*: Refactored CSS `.file-item` and JS `updateFileList`. Completely rewrote the `drop` event listener to use `FileReader.readAsDataURL()`. Updated `submitProcess()` to NOT navigate instantly, but instead increment `window.activeProcesses` and listen for `process_complete`.\n- **`d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\app.py`**\n  - *Changes*: Removed the old `window.events.dropped += on_dropped` logic to prevent deadlocks.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n**Current Status:** I just updated the event logic bridging Python processing and JS UI to prevent the \"0 0 0\" glitch. I also fixed the Drag & Drop and UI styling issues. \n\n**Next Steps for the Next Agent:**\n\n1. **Verify the Processing Pipeline UI:**\n   - Open `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`.\n   - Ensure the `process_update` event updates a real **Progress Bar UI element** (width 0-100%) in the `progress-area`, not just text.\n   - Verify that `submitProcess` correctly handles the `result.existing` duplicate response and navigates to the pre-calculated results.\n\n2. **Fix the Application Scroll (Responsiveness):**\n   - In `index.html`, modify the CSS so the `body` and main layout have `overflow: hidden`, and only specific inner containers (like the file list or history table) have `overflow-y: auto`.\n\n3. **Implement Exit Warning:**\n   - In `index.html`, update `exitApp()`:\n     ```javascript\n     if (window.activeProcesses > 0) {\n         if (!confirm(\"يوجد عمليات قيد التشغيل في الخلفية. هل أنت متأكد من رغبتك في الإغلاق؟\")) return;\n     }\n     ```\n\n4. **Verify English Logs & History Loading:**\n   - Check `backend.py`'s `_process_worker` to ensure all `add_log()` calls are in English.\n   - Ensure `loadHistory()` in `index.html` pulls correctly from `self.db.get_all_processes()` so the History screen updates when the user visits it.\n\nYou have the 14 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006220414]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006220414.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006245677]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006245677.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790008142552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790008142552.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T16:29:03Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030764891]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790030764891.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:46:21Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030964763]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/med