{"step_index":557,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:50:13Z","thinking":"**Observing Progress Indicators**\n\nI'm currently focused on the progress indicators. I see the HTML structure for a \"progress-area,\" which includes a spinner and text. Right now, it's hidden, and I'm considering how this will be utilized to inform the user of the tasks in progress. I'm taking the \"hidden\" attribute into consideration.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update progress listener to correctly update UI text and add progress bar","EndLine":1270,"Instruction":"Update the process_update event listener to properly target #progress-text, and add an animated progress bar inside progress-area in the HTML.","ReplacementContent":"window.addEventListener('process_update', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n    if (progressArea && !progressArea.classList.contains('hidden') && data.process_id === currentProcessId) {\n        const msgEl = document.getElementById('progress-text');\n        if (msgEl && data.message) msgEl.innerText = data.message;\n        \n        const pb = document.getElementById('progress-bar-fill');\n        if (pb) {\n            // Very simple heuristic to advance progress bar based on text\n            let pct = 10;\n            if (data.message.includes('استخراج') || data.message.includes('Extracting')) pct = 30;\n            if (data.message.includes('مطابقة') || data.message.includes('Matching')) pct = 60;\n            if (data.message.includes('حفظ') || data.message.includes('Saving')) pct = 90;\n            pb.style.width = pct + '%';\n        }\n    }\n});","StartLine":1255,"TargetContent":"window.addEventListener('process_update', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    const progressArea = document.getElementById('progress-area');\n    if (progressArea && !progressArea.c